WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
Leo owns a restaurant.
Today is his day off.

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.180
Easy questions. Rosalia answers them
herself and leaves him alone.

3
00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:10.980
A table for eight needs him.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.080
She tells them it's no problem
and that they close at 10 p.m.
